---
description:
  An edge enters the subgraph from above through the middle of its top border. The title is
  at the top left, clear of the edge, and the second subgraph's own position overrides the
  config with bottom-center (mermaid-js/mermaid#2977).
config:
  flowchart:
    subGraphTitlePosition: top-left
---
flowchart TD
    Root ==> Child
    subgraph Items
        Child --> ThingA
        Child --> ThingB
        Child --> ThingC
    end
    subgraph Notes
        ThingB --> Note
    end
    Notes@{ titlePosition: bottom-center }
